SUMMARY:Streamlining newsletter production: A peer-learning opportunity
DESCRIPTION:Assembling a newsletter\, especially a daily\, can be tedious and time-consuming — pulling links\, writing summaries\, formatting\, scheduling\, and proofreading can eat up hours. But it doesn’t have to. Learn from INN members who have streamlined the process using a mix of automation\, AI assistance\, templates\, and smart editorial workflows — some getting their daily build down to mere minutes. Come prepared to show and tell your current process\, your pain points\, and any tools or hacks you’ve found useful. You’ll leave with practical ideas you can put to work in your newsroom.
URL:https://inn.org/event/streamlining-newsletter-production-a-peer-learning-opportunity/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://inn.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/INN-Events-Audience-Development-e1778081176865.jpg
END:VEVENT
