SUMMARY:RNN Onboarding: Getting Started with Sunlight Research Desk
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a brief onboarding session to kick off the Rural News Network’s partnership with MuckRock and the Sunlight Research Desk. We’ll walk through your new premium benefits—including research support\, investigative tools\, workshops and office hours — and show you how to access and make the most of these resources as you cover the upcoming midterm elections. There will be time for questions and a quick demo to get your newsroom set up for success.
URL:https://inn.org/event/rnn-onboarding-getting-started-with-sunlight-research-desk-4/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://inn.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/5c11c7ad-af4b-4f89-864c-910bfa1bf816.png
END:VEVENT
