SUMMARY:INN Days 2026
DESCRIPTION:Join the Institute for Nonprofit News in Pittsburgh from June 16-18 for INN Days 2026. \nINN Days brings together news leaders\, technologists and business strategists to identify and solve the nonprofit news field’s toughest challenges. This is an opportunity for decision-makers to dive deep and learn practical strategies for strengthening news as a public good.
URL:https://inn.org/event/inn-days-2026/
LOCATION:Wyndham Grand Pittsburgh Downtown
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://inn.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Final_INN-Days_2026_INN-Days-2026_Tagline_HORI_2-color-scaled.png
END:VEVENT
